<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Privacy policy' }) %>
<body>
  <main class="container py-5" style="max-width:44rem">
    <div class="mb-4"><%- include('partials/brand') %></div>
    <h1 class="h3 mb-4">Privacy policy</h1>
    <div class="card"><div class="card-body d-grid gap-3">
      <p class="text-secondary mb-0">Last updated: November 2026. This is a starter template — replace it with your own policy before going to production.</p>
      <h2 class="h6 mb-0">What we store</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary mb-0">Your username, email and password (only as a cryptographic hash). Optional details such as phone, address, birth date and profile information are stored only if you provide them.</p>
      <h2 class="h6 mb-0">What we share</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary mb-0">Applications you authorize receive only the information covered by the permissions you accepted, and nothing else. We never share your password.</p>
      <h2 class="h6 mb-0">Your control</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary mb-0">From your account page you can review active sessions and authorized applications, export your data and delete your account.</p>
    </div></div>
    <p class="form-text mt-4"><a href="/signup">Back to sign up</a></p>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
